---
description: Solidity contract scope and receipt invariants.
globs: contracts/**
alwaysApply: false
---

The contract records a ciphertext digest and wallet acknowledgement only. Never add plaintext, keys,
salts, filenames, payment logic, admin bypasses, or an on-chain key-proof function. Preserve one open,
recipient, and expiry invariants. Add a failing test before every contract behavior change.
